    "turn_text": "Welcome to the Field Talk podcast from the Linder Farm Network, the voice of Minnesota agriculture. There's likely no more influential piece of legislation affecting agriculture than the Farm Bill. Lawmakers across the country have begun holding listening sessions and farm groups are organizing their priority issues for the 2023 Farm Bill. Former Congressman and U.S. Ag Committee Chairman Colin Peterson has been involved with crafting numerous farm bills and he recently talked with Lynn Kettlesen about some of the factors likely to affect the next one.",
